<p>NOTE: 1996 periods include (a) charges of $79.0 million, or $2.63 per share, primarily for the planned closure of the Port Angeles pulp mill, and charges of $98.2 million, or $3.28 per share, to implement AICPA Statement of Position 96-1 related to future environmental monitoring costs.</p>
<p>1995 year includes (b) $23.9 million, or $0.80 per share, for a non-recurring gain related to the sale of an interest in New Zealand assets.</p>
<p>(c) Net income excluding special items excludes non-recurring charges or gains.</p>
